			"hadithnumber": 2145,
			"arabicnumber": 2145,
			"text": "It was narrated that Qais bin Abu Gharazah said:\"At the time of the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) we used to be called brokers, but the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) passed by us and called by a name that was better than that. He said: 'O merchants, selling involves (false) oaths and idle talk, so mix some charity with it",
